Dialogue: 1,0:00:00.08,0:00:03.24,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\pos(490,1160)}A gift for her mother was the\Nexplanation Amy Mihaljevic
Dialogue: 1,0:00:03.30,0:00:06.38,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\pos(490,1160)}was given for an after-school\Nmeeting.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:06.40,0:00:07.14,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\pos(490,1160)}Amy was ten.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:08.08,0:00:12.51,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\pos(490,1160)}Before she disappeared on\NOctober 27, 1989, a
Dialogue: 1,0:00:12.59,0:00:15.57,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\pos(490,1160)}caller had contacted her\Nabout celebrating her
Dialogue: 1,0:00:15.63,0:00:19.67,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\pos(490,1160)}mother’s promotion. Bay\NVillage Police say that contact
Dialogue: 1,0:00:19.71,0:00:20.91,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\pos(490,1160)}happened weeks earlier.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:21.65,0:00:24.93,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\pos(490,1160)}The FBI says Amy walked\Nfrom school to Bay Village
Dialogue: 1,0:00:24.97,0:00:28.35,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\pos(490,1160)}Square in Ohio, where she\Nwas seen apparently waiting
Dialogue: 1,0:00:28.45,0:00:29.34,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\pos(490,1160)}outside a business.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:30.32,0:00:33.46,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\pos(490,1160)}Police describe witnesses\Nseeing her speak with an
Dialogue: 1,0:00:33.62,0:00:36.70,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\pos(490,1160)}unidentified man and walk\Nthrough the parking lot with
Dialogue: 1,0:00:36.76,0:00:40.14,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\pos(490,1160)}him. No vehicle was seen,\Naccording to police.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:41.26,0:00:43.78,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\pos(490,1160)}That sighting does not\Nestablish where Amy went
Dialogue: 1,0:00:43.82,0:00:44.10,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\pos(490,1160)}next.
